          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        Esra 4:24—5:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.6.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa bushiku ubwakutampa umweshi uwalenga mutanda",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila umweshi wa kasakantobo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", mu mwaka walengele ibili apo Dariusi abelele imfumu nkalamba iya calo ca Pesia, elyo ishiwi lyakwa Yawe lyaishile kuli kasesema Hagai. Ili ishiwi lyali lyakuya eba umulashi wa calo uwaleitwa Serubabeli mwana Shealitieli, no kuya ebako shimapepo mukalamba Yoshua mwana Yehosadaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
